// This workspace ties arnon's three modules together for local development:
// one editor/`go build` session across all three from the repo root, without
// `cd`-ing into each. CI doesn't rely on it - Makefile targets `cd` into each
// module explicitly.
//
// Consumers never see this file - `go.work` is ignored outside the workspace
// root, so it has no effect on anyone who runs `go get github.com/casara/arnon`.
//
// See docs/architecture/adr-0001-module-layout.md, section "go.work is
// committed", for why this file's role shifts once observability/otel is
// first released, and for the release ordering itself.
go 1.26

use (
	.
	./examples
	./observability/otel
)
